{"date":"2010-12-03","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e9/58/23682_V0XqZ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e9/58/23682_V0XqZ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e9/58/23682_V0XqZ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e9/58/23682_V0XqZ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e9/58/23682_V0XqZ.jpg"},"summary":"　　《MojoSpy--魔角侦探》改编自著名少儿节目主持人陈岳的畅销书《齐乐天和老舅侦探》，\r\n　　宁静的海边小镇“金枪鱼镇”里，有一位红发问题少年齐乐天。他无意中卷入了一起错综复杂的盗窃案，在天真活泼爱喝果汁的天使菁菁、冷酷的高智能机械人霍星等伙伴的帮助下，误打误撞地协助警方侦破了这起性质恶劣的刑事案件。当众人皆以为一切顺利结束时，盗窃案的真正幕后黑手却悄悄浮现，并向齐乐天发起了最终极的挑战……齐乐天该勇敢接受挑战？还是懦弱地退却……魔角侦探的故事就此展开，属于世界的中国少年小侦探从此诞生。","name":"魔角侦探","name_cn":"","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":290,"total_count":159843},{"name":"童年","count":217,"total_count":92547},{"name":"TV","count":130,"total_count":1391012},{"name":"2010","count":103,"total_count":43317},{"name":"侦探","count":100,"total_count":616},{"name":"奇幻","count":86,"total_count":464001},{"name":"搞笑","count":77,"total_count":632666},{"name":"国产动画","count":69,"total_count":5614},{"name":"背景精良","count":37,"total_count":57},{"name":"悬疑","count":35,"total_count":112451},{"name":"原创","count":33,"total_count":614157},{"name":"好看","count":29,"total_count":1524},{"name":"良心","count":24,"total_count":468},{"name":"中国","count":17,"total_count":31133},{"name":"禹田","count":13,"total_count":16},{"name":"冒险","count":12,"total_count":52944},{"name":"2010年","count":11,"total_count":2384},{"name":"推理","count":10,"total_count":72906},{"name":"霍妹嫁我","count":6,"total_count":8},{"name":"战斗","count":6,"total_count":465227},{"name":"童年良心","count":6,"total_count":7},{"name":"2010年12月","count":5,"total_count":211},{"name":"禹田文化","count":4,"total_count":6},{"name":"热血","count":3,"total_count":211119},{"name":"童年回忆","count":3,"total_count":1060},{"name":"神作","count":3,"total_count":47551},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35475},{"name":"刘宁","count":2,"total_count":5},{"name":"国漫","count":2,"total_count":15575},{"name":"